msgid "Update post"
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/core-content.php:259
msgid "Updates an existing post by id. Only the fields you pass are changed; omitted fields are left untouched. Accepts the same fields as create-post, including slug, author, and custom fields via \"meta\" (null deletes a key). WordPress stores a revision, so changes are recoverable (non-destructive). Returns the updated summary. For an item of a custom content type, pass its post_type."
msgstr ""

