msgid "Delete post"
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/core-content.php:272
msgid "Deletes a post. DESTRUCTIVE — runs through a two-step confirmation: the first call returns a preview and a confirm_token without changing anything; call again with confirm_token to execute. Without \"force\" the post is trashed (recoverable); with force=true it is permanently deleted (not recoverable). For an item of a custom content type, pass its post_type."
